'''Perfect Footwork''' is a [[Combat Achievements/Grandmaster|grandmaster combat achievement]] which requires the player to defeat [[Sol Heredit]] without taking any damage from his Spear, Shield, Grapple, or Triple Attack.

==Strategy==
The player is allowed to be damaged by anything that is not one of Sol's attacks, so it is possible to step on [[molten sand]] or solar flares temporarily if needed to dodge an attack.

